/*
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Component gate Nextflow config: the modules harness plus this host's resource cap
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Personal-track development infrastructure. It is not part of the portable pipeline
    and never enters an upstream pipeline or component diff.

    `nf-test -c` takes an *nf-test* config, not a Nextflow config, so the cap cannot be
    passed to `nf-test` directly. It reaches Nextflow through the `configFile` entry of
    `host_nf-test.config` beside this file, which points here. This file keeps the
    upstream harness the components are written against and adds the cap after it.

    Set `NFT_MODULES_ROOT` to the `nf-core/modules` worktree root before the run.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/

includeConfig "${System.getenv('NFT_MODULES_ROOT')}/tests/config/nf-test.config"
includeConfig 'host_resources.config'
